OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigate racist remarks 
OL,4,Aafter crash                            
OL,6,FPolice are investigating reports of    
OL,7,Fracist comments made after a crash in  
OL,8,FStoke-on-Trent, while stressing there  
OL,9,Fis no evidence a vehicle was           
OL,10,Fdeliberately driven at children leaving
OL,11,Fa nearby mosque.                       
OL,13,FThe crash involved a Vauxhall Insignia 
OL,14,Fand a grey Hyundai Ioniq taxi in the   
OL,15,Fcar park of the Aldi supermarket on    
OL,16,FTrentham Road, Longton, on Friday.     
OL,18,FStaffordshire Police said the driver of
OL,19,Fthe Vauxhall allegedly directed racist 
OL,20,Fcomments towards the occupants of the  
OL,21,Ftaxi before leaving the scene.         
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
