OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigate racist remarks 
OL,4,Aafter crash                            
OL,6,FThe force said it was aware of social  
OL,7,Fmedia posts circulating about the      
OL,8,Fincident and had carried out inquiries 
OL,9,Fto establish the circumstances.        
